    "summary": "An unfinished woman&#039;s blouse sleeve; an embroidery-sample.  Square in shape, with a long, rectangular embroidered pattern.  Ground of natural cream tabby woven cotton cloth.  Snowflake or geometric floral motifs, worked on the diagonal, within a diamond and a larger trellis pattern.  Lines of pink, purple and yellow motifs, using wool (with synthetic) yarns and polychrome plastic (?) tinsel thread.  Overstitching at the top and bottom edge; selvedges on the other two sides.",
